From: Evgeniy Yelagin <evgeniy@kolibr.io>
Date: Wed, 15 Apr 2026 18:23:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] tpu-proxy: post-sigverify transaction forwarding
 (v3.1.7-v3.1.8)

Forward verified TPU transactions to external UDP endpoints after
signature verification. Appends 32-byte validator identity to each
datagram. Supports CLI --tpu-proxy-address and runtime RPC
setTpuProxyAddresses.

